// Touch-ally ward vs aberrations/celestials/elementals/fey/fiends/undead --
// the exact same `OtherworldlyWard` BuffKind dispel_evil_and_good.ron
// already uses for its own self-cast otherworldly ward (see that file's
// comment: no creature-kind-conditional resistance primitive exists, so it
// reduces all incoming damage while it holds rather than only damage from
// the listed creature kinds). Delivered here as a touch-ally `BasicAura`
// instead of `SelfBuff`, since this spell's own description is explicitly
// "a willing creature you touch", not the caster.
//
// `duration: Some(60.0)` deliberately matches the sheet's own
// `Concentration(60)` field, not D&D canon's 10-minute (600s) version --
// the sheet already shortens this spell's concentration window before it
// ever reaches this file (unlike telekinesis.ron, which does carry its
// canon 600s duration for a spell whose sheet wasn't shortened).
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: OtherworldlyWard,
            strength: 0.25,
            duration: Some(60.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(60.0),
    range: 2.0,
    energy_cost: 30.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Divine)),
)
